msgid ""
":gh:`2705`: [Linux]: :meth:`Process.wait` now uses ``pidfd_open()`` + "
"``poll()`` (no busy loop). Requires Linux >= 5.3 and Python >= 3.9."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:410
msgid ""
